    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Back To School</strong> is an indie psychological horror, puzzle, walking simulator game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Description:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a parent that  attended the high school your daughter now attends. Upon receiving a call from the principal, you now head to back to school in order to pick her up and leave as quickly as possible...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The Flashlight:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get &quot;teleported&quot; to the dark side of the school for reasons you don't know. Use your flashlight to be able to see ahead of you and be prepared for anything luring in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The School:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the school to find notes or other items you can pick up to start piecing together why you are here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hidden areas to uncover the mystery of why you are in such a dark place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Story:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have bad memories from going to this school, and now those bad memories will hunt you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your daughter and leave quickly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Back To School</strong> is an indie psychological horror, puzzle, walking simulator game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Description:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a parent that  attended the high school your daughter now attends. Upon receiving a call from the principal, you now head to back to school in order to pick her up and leave as quickly as possible...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The Flashlight:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get &quot;teleported&quot; to the dark side of the school for reasons you don't know. Use your flashlight to be able to see ahead of you and be prepared for anything luring in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The School:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the school to find notes or other items you can pick up to start piecing together why you are here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hidden areas to uncover the mystery of why you are in such a dark place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Story:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have bad memories from going to this school, and now those bad memories will hunt you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your daughter and leave quickly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "In an attempt to pick up your daughter from school, you must face your past and overcome your deepest fears. This is a psychological horror game where you are a parent going back to school.",
